[h2]Build 0.9.36[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]VFE belts no longer empty a factory hopper that a conveyor arm takes from or puts into: that hopper is left to the arm.
[*]VFE belts no longer take from a machine's input hopper, or from a hopper whose own "allow taking" is switched off.
[/list]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]"Pull from hoppers" toggle on belts next to a factory hopper, to stop a belt taking from a hopper that only happens to touch it.
[/list]
